Phase 0 — Environment Setup ⚙️

First we prepare the lab.

Tasks

 Create project repository

 Create virtual environment

 Install dependencies

 Test webcam capture

 Verify InsightFace model loads

Tools
Python
OpenCV
InsightFace
NumPy
FastAPI
SQLite
Expected output
Webcam feed opens successfully
Phase 1 — Face Recognition Engine 🧠

This is the core brain.

Everything else depends on this.

Tasks
Face Detection

 Load SCRFD detector

 Detect faces in frame

 Draw bounding boxes

Face Embedding

 Load ArcFace model

 Extract 512-dim embedding

 Verify embedding consistency

Face Matching

 Implement cosine similarity

 Test embedding comparisons

 Tune similarity threshold

Output
Camera detects face
Embedding extracted
Matching working
Phase 2 — Face Registration System 👤

Users must register once.

Tasks

 Capture multiple frames

 Detect face

 Extract embeddings

 Average embeddings

 Store user data

Registration Flow
User clicks register
↓
Camera captures 5 images
↓
Embeddings extracted
↓
Average embedding computed
↓
Stored in database
Phase 3 — Database System 🗄

