Phase 4 — Attendance Logic 📅

This is the business logic layer.

Tasks

 Match recognized user

 Check attendance today

 Mark attendance

 Prevent duplicates

 Implement cooldown

Rules
Only one attendance per day
Recognition threshold must pass
Duplicate detection prevented
Phase 5 — Real-Time Recognition System 🎥

Now we integrate everything.

Tasks

 Continuous webcam stream

 Detect faces

 Extract embeddings

 Compare database embeddings

 Identify user

 Trigger attendance

Output Example
Face detected
User: Vedant
Attendance marked
Phase 6 — API Backend 🌐

Now we make the system programmable.

Using FastAPI.

Endpoints
Register user
POST /register

Input

name
email
face_images
Recognize face
POST /recognize

Output

user_id
confidence
attendance_status
Attendance report
GET /attendance/today
List users
GET /users
